#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:9
msgid "Interactive Demos"
msgstr "交互演示"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:11
msgid ""
"Explore physics and trained policies in your browser—no installation "
"required. Select a demo below to get started."
msgstr "直接在浏览器中体验物理仿真和训练好的策略，无需安装。选择下方示例开始。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:17
msgid "VBD material stiffness"
msgstr "VBD 材料刚度"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:23
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:34
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:45
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:56
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:67
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:78
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:89
msgid ":bdg-info:`Tuning`"
msgstr ":bdg-info:`调优`"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:25
msgid ""
"Compare three deformable cubes. Adjust shear, volume stiffness, damping, and"
" gravity, then repeat the same drop."
msgstr "对比三个可变形立方体。调整剪切刚度、体积刚度、阻尼和重力，再重复同一次下落过程。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:28
msgid "VBD cloth bending"
msgstr "VBD 布料弯曲"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:36
msgid ""
"Compare cloth sheets draping over rollers. Change the middle sheet's bending"
" stiffness and gravity."
msgstr "对比布料垂落在滚筒上的效果，调整中间布料的弯曲刚度和重力。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:39
msgid "MJWarp sliding friction"
msgstr "MJWarp 滑动摩擦"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:47
msgid ""
"Change a box's friction on an incline and compare its sliding motion with "
"two fixed material references."
msgstr "改变斜面上方块的摩擦参数，将其滑动过程与两个参数固定的参考方块对比。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:50
msgid "Joint PD tuning"
msgstr "关节 PD 调参"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:58
msgid ""
"Tune a suspended three-joint arm with step and sine commands. Compare target"
" and measured angles on the live tracking plot."
msgstr "用阶跃和正弦指令调试悬挂的三关节机械臂，在实时跟踪曲线中对比目标角度和实测角度。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:61
msgid "MPM material response"
msgstr "MPM 材料响应"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:69
msgid ""
"Drop 2,744 fine particles onto a cylinder inside a catch tub. Try sand, "
"snow, clay, and water references, or tune individual parameters."
msgstr "将 2,744 个细粒子落到接料槽内的圆柱上。可尝试沙、雪、黏土和水的参考设置，或分别调整参数。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:72
msgid "VBD cable bending"
msgstr "VBD 线缆弯曲"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:80
msgid ""
"Bend a clamped 0.45 m, ten-segment cable. Adjust bending stiffness and "
"downward tip load, then reset to compare the response."
msgstr "弯曲一根固定一端、长 0.45 m、分为十段的线缆。调整弯曲刚度和末端向下载荷，再重置以比较响应。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:83
msgid "Domino cascade"
msgstr "多米诺骨牌连锁"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:91
msgid ""
"Topple 24 slabs with a short push. Change friction and replay the cascade "
"using Newton XPBD and the Isaac Lab checker ground."
msgstr "用短暂推力推倒 24 块骨牌，调整摩擦后，使用 Newton XPBD 和 Isaac Lab 棋盘格地面重播连锁倾倒过程。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:94
msgid "Cartpole balancing"
msgstr "Cartpole 平衡"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:100
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:111
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:122
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:133
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:144
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:155
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:166
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:177
#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:188
msgid ":bdg-success:`Policy`"
msgstr ":bdg-success:`策略`"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:102
msgid ""
"Push a pretrained balancing policy with up to 300 N in either direction. "
"Release the slider to watch it recover."
msgstr "对预训练的平衡策略施加任一方向、最大 300 N 的推力。松开滑块，观察它恢复平衡。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:105
msgid "G1 velocity control"
msgstr "G1 速度控制"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:113
msgid ""
"Command forward, sideways, and turning motion with travel and yaw pads using"
" the published WBC-AGILE policy."
msgstr "使用已发布的 WBC-AGILE 策略，通过平移和转向控制区指挥机器人前进、侧移和转弯。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:116
msgid "ANYmal-D velocity control"
msgstr "ANYmal-D 速度控制"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:124
msgid ""
"Drive an ANYmal-D with travel and yaw pads using a published Isaac Lab "
"Newton checkpoint."
msgstr "使用已发布的 Isaac Lab Newton 检查点，通过平移和转向控制区操纵 ANYmal-D。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:127
msgid "MicroDuck walking"
msgstr "MicroDuck 行走"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:135
msgid ""
"Walk in a bounded warehouse. Drag sticks to their edges to lock commands; "
"pull back or press Escape to stop. Drag the robot for a 2 N push."
msgstr "在有边界的仓库中行走。将摇杆拖到边缘可锁定命令，拉回或按 Escape 停止；拖动机器人可施加 2 N 推力。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:138
msgid "Franka reach"
msgstr "Franka 目标到达"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:146
msgid ""
"Move the target position and watch a pretrained joint-position policy reach "
"for it."
msgstr "移动目标位置，观察预训练的关节位置策略如何让末端到达目标。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:149
msgid "Franka lift"
msgstr "Franka 物体抬升"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:157
msgid ""
"Watch a pretrained policy lift a cube from a pregrasp reset. Adjust its "
"target position, pause, or replay the episode."
msgstr "从预抓取的重置状态开始，观察预训练策略抬起立方体。可以调整目标位置、暂停或重放回合。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:160
msgid "Franka drawer opening"
msgstr "Franka 打开抽屉"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:168
msgid ""
"Play, pause, and reset a pretrained drawer-opening policy. Orbit the camera "
"to inspect the grasp and drawer motion."
msgstr "播放、暂停或重置预训练的开抽屉策略，环绕移动相机，观察抓取和抽屉运动。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:171
msgid "Franka soft-body policy"
msgstr "Franka 软体策略"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:179
msgid ""
"Lift a flexible beam with a pretrained VBD policy. Change its target height "
"or stiffness, or pull the beam to test recovery."
msgstr "使用预训练 VBD 策略抬升柔性梁。调整目标高度或刚度，也可拉动梁以测试恢复能力。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:182
msgid "Franka cloth policy"
msgstr "Franka 布料策略"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:190
msgid ""
"Watch a pretrained VBD policy grasp a cloth sheet through contact. Adjust "
"bending stiffness or target height, or pull the cloth."
msgstr "观看预训练 VBD 策略通过接触抓握布料。可以调整弯曲刚度、目标高度，或拉动布料。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:193
msgid "Franka cube stacking"
msgstr "Franka 方块堆叠"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:199
msgid ":bdg-secondary:`Scripted`"
msgstr ":bdg-secondary:`脚本控制`"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:201
msgid ""
"Stack two 50 mm cubes with a scripted IK controller and simulated gripper "
"contacts, or take over the arm in Manual mode."
msgstr "使用脚本化 IK 控制器与仿真夹爪接触堆叠两个 50 mm 方块，也可在手动模式下接管机械臂。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:205
msgid "About these demos"
msgstr "关于这些演示"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:207
msgid ""
"Each demo runs a Newton simulation locally on your CPU through WebAssembly, "
"with camera controls, pause, and reset. Simplified scenes and adapted policy"
" playback can behave differently from native tasks. Use the full Isaac Lab "
":ref:`environments <environment-browser>` for training and measured "
"comparisons."
msgstr ""
"每个示例通过 WebAssembly 在本地 CPU 上运行 Newton "
"仿真，提供相机控制、暂停和重置。简化场景与适配后的策略播放可能与原生任务表现不同；训练和定量比较请使用完整的 Isaac Lab :ref:`环境 "
"<environment-browser>`。"

#: source/isaaclab/interactive_demos.rst:211
msgid ""
"Simulation bundles, policy checkpoints, exporters, and third-party license "
"notices are distributed through the `interactive-demos release "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/interactive-demos>`_. "
"See the `original implementation <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/pull/7974>`_."
msgstr ""
"仿真资源包、策略检查点、导出器和第三方许可证声明通过 `interactive-demos 发布页 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/interactive-demos>`_ 分发。另见 `最初实现 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/pull/7974>`_。"
